786965d5a8f1fcba3f16c43a612ce1462952f23edf0c5efe72dacb53aad24f64  .codex/skills/agent-loop/scripts/agent-loop.sh  NOT-A-LAUNCH: `run_review_pass Claude claude "$CLAUDE_REVIEW_HOOK" ...` — byte-identical to the .agents region
